    {
      "id": "956bbded-8b6c-4bd5-b2f3-5e9b5384b5ea",
      "title": "Escute a frase e perceba como o plano muda quando o verbo passa a falar de presentear.",
      "description": null,
      "contentType": 6,
      "sequenceItem": 4,
      "items": [
        {
          "id": "5fc67737-4627-45bd-80f9-5832aa14b3e3",
          "textContent": "<p>Escute e observe o presente.</p><p><strong>Voy a regalar una planta a Rosa.</strong></p><p>Em português: <strong>Vou dar uma planta de presente para a Rosa.</strong></p>",
          "fileUrl": null,
          "videoUrl": null,
          "imageUrl": null,
          "audioUrl": "https://d2tew3rxpxsvy8.cloudfront.net/content/aadd26ddda9d43ae8bf10d7ae82a256f_b04-voy-a-regalar-una-planta-a-rosa.mp3?Expires=1794099521&Signature=p-zUTm3djH4Aa4ui-NZWds~4UHztir3PPtnt21uNQ2Isrp-4Kv4qtWFpr-AoR3k1wu5psTuYVr1wNxd83bIDOTPSu5oNnZlSCcJDyldhk56G7n3Q8laexOVcE~MP0IoT52nh7nHI6uHqqnGRhtrn7n-PU1uJ-BD2O2w0QZc6P460t359jgyc1HHr8751ZC68kOlDJy~BQTxhvnZiwuohxj44mkyQAqm0RqhoGrJbmeJMWOqHJjlKrDGsON087ydPku1xNWs5SWCra9tgRkgz1Ut-NJN5jjXP6kY52QySCj7KX8NSNdqZsi2g~bLvKDSFqmndLnkuU1eO58ncGPPuRg__&Key-Pair-Id=K26R6VFB46REEJ"
